    {"id": "setup", "en": "setup", "pos": "noun", "match": ["setup", "setups"], "notes": "The whole set of apps, settings and files on a laptop. Shares its root with 'setting' in pt; keep the pt word distinct in use (setup = 'instalação' is NOT used). The whole set of apps, settings and files on a laptop. Must not share its word with settings. Current conflicts: pt configuração (also setting) and ar إعدادات (also setting). Polyglot decision pending; see the report.", "fr": ["configuration", "configurations"], "es": ["configuración", "configuraciones"], "pt": ["configuração", "configurações"], "ar": ["الإعداد الكامل", "إعدادات الجهاز"], "hi": ["सेटअप"], "zh-CN": ["配置"]},
